cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AUTOMA or its 4-Layer Cognitive Brain in your research, mods, or autonomous agent benchmarks, please cite it as below."
title: "AUTOMA: Autonomous Play Architecture for Single-Player Games"
abstract: "An open-source cognitive architecture and reverse-engineering protocol that equips AI coding agents to inject 4-layer, user-configurable game autonomy (Orchestrator, Regressive A* GOAP, Compensated Utility AI, and 16-Slot Context Steering) with user-selectable Tactical and Cinematic presentation modes into existing single-player games."
